      "name": "Note \u2014 Bar Chart",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 210,
      "content": "Bar chart updates:\n\n\u2022 Bars are wider \u2014 spacing between categories was reduced so each bar reads as a bigger, bolder block.\n\u2022 No gridlines or dividers run through the bars.\n\u2022 No shaded/gray plot background sits behind the bars \u2014 they sit directly on the card."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "Zfczb",
      "x": -420,
      "y": 1886,
      "name": "Note \u2014 Donut Chart",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "content": "Donut chart updates:\n\n\u2022 The faded/gray wash was removed; every wedge now uses its full, solid color."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "uXYrs",
      "x": -420,
      "y": 2578,
      "name": "Note \u2014 Removed Charts",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "content": "Removed chart types:\n\n\u2022 Radial, Pie, Radar, and Scatter charts are not in the shown palette.\n\u2022 Pie was kept and restyled as the Donut Chart above.\n\u2022 Radar and Scatter may be re-added later (removed 2026-08-13 per the show-list decision).\n\u2022 HeatmapChart was added 2026-08-17."
    },
    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "b8D21",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 480,
      "name": "Note \u2014 Responsive Bars",
      "width": 520,
      "height": 240,
      "content": "Bar chart \u2014 responsive behavior:\n\n\u2022 Bars widen and narrow with the viewport instead of staying a fixed size.\n\u2022 Bar width is capped at a maximum; past that point the chart stops growing and the extra space becomes side margin.\n\u2022 When space gets tight, the gap between bars within a single category collapses first \u2014 gaps between categories are preserved so groupings stay legible."
    },
